              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "contanto que — \"as long as, on condition that\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Empresto-te o carro, contanto que tenhas cuidado. I will lend you the car, as long as you are careful."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Takes the subjunctive; a little more formal than desde que."
            }
          ]
        },
