              "text": "caso — \"in case, if (+ subjunctive); the case\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Caso chova, o jantar é dentro de casa. If it rains, dinner is indoors."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Caso + present subjunctive: caso chova. As a noun, o caso is the case: neste caso."
